[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3721325471","pull_request_review_id":4865351301,"id":3721325471,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7dzuuf","diff_hunk":"@@ -1376,6 +1376,7 @@ LightmapGI::BakeError LightmapGI::bake(Node *p_from_node, String p_image_data_pa\n \t\t\tif (use_physical_light_units) {\n \t\t\t\tenergy *= light->get_param(Light3D::PARAM_INTENSITY);\n \t\t\t\tlinear_color *= light->get_correlated_color().srgb_to_linear();\n+\t\t\t\tenergy *= 1.0 / Math::PI;","path":"scene/3d/lightmap_gi.cpp","commit_id":"aecdb33556226d4944b3cbdd77ab44465109d9de","original_commit_id":"aecdb33556226d4944b3cbdd77ab44465109d9de","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm not sure this is correct. Look at the code in the renderer:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ac7ef92b78e66c6fd8e10144ac83a6ac997c7224/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp#L2003-L2018\n\nNote how non physical lights get multiplied by PI. Is it possible that multiplication is happening somewhere here too but it is applied to all lights? ","created_at":"2026-08-05T14:18:22Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T14:18:25Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122131#discussion_r3721325471","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122131","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3721325471"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122131#discussion_r3721325471"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122131"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3721325471/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1379,"original_line":1379,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3722351419","pull_request_review_id":4866669222,"id":3722351419,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7d3pM7","diff_hunk":"@@ -1376,6 +1376,7 @@ LightmapGI::BakeError LightmapGI::bake(Node *p_from_node, String p_image_data_pa\n \t\t\tif (use_physical_light_units) {\n \t\t\t\tenergy *= light->get_param(Light3D::PARAM_INTENSITY);\n \t\t\t\tlinear_color *= light->get_correlated_color().srgb_to_linear();\n+\t\t\t\tenergy *= 1.0 / Math::PI;","path":"scene/3d/lightmap_gi.cpp","commit_id":"aecdb33556226d4944b3cbdd77ab44465109d9de","original_commit_id":"aecdb33556226d4944b3cbdd77ab44465109d9de","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The *PI for non-physical lights is applied in the renderer, but it is later canceled by the 1/PI in the real-time diffuse BRDF.\r\n\r\nIn scene_forward_lights_inc.glsl:227, Lambert diffuse is calculated as:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndiffuse_brdf_NL = cNdotL * (1.0 / M_PI);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe lightmapper does not use that BRDF calculation. In lm_compute.glsl, direct light ends with:\r\n\r\n```\r\nr_light = light_data.energy * attenuation * penumbra * penumbra_color;\r\n```\r\n\r\nattenuation includes NdotL, but I could not find a common PI or 1/PI normalization after this. The lightmap is then sampled as irradiance and multiplied directly by albedo.\r\n\r\nTherefore:\r\nNon-physical real-time: energy × PI × 1/PI = energy\r\nNon-physical baked:    energy\r\n\r\nPhysical real-time:    physical_conversion × 1/PI\r\nPhysical baked:        physical_conversion","created_at":"2026-08-05T16:38:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T16:38:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122131#discussion_r3722351419","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122131","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3722351419"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122131#discussion_r3722351419"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122131"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3722351419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1379,"original_line":1379,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3721325471,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3723816218","pull_request_review_id":4868501413,"id":3723816218,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7d9O0a","diff_hunk":"@@ -1376,6 +1376,7 @@ LightmapGI::BakeError LightmapGI::bake(Node *p_from_node, String p_image_data_pa\n \t\t\tif (use_physical_light_units) {\n \t\t\t\tenergy *= light->get_param(Light3D::PARAM_INTENSITY);\n \t\t\t\tlinear_color *= light->get_correlated_color().srgb_to_linear();\n+\t\t\t\tenergy *= 1.0 / Math::PI;","path":"scene/3d/lightmap_gi.cpp","commit_id":"aecdb33556226d4944b3cbdd77ab44465109d9de","original_commit_id":"aecdb33556226d4944b3cbdd77ab44465109d9de","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Ahhhh okay. Makes sense. I guess its fine then since the lightmapper always uses lambert","created_at":"2026-08-